                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[h1]Just desserts.[/h1]\nYes, You'll get your just desserts if you try it. :D\nIt's almost like Candy Crush... on ritilin. \nIt's cute, and simple, so you're probably not expecting much more anyways. But, there are a few simple flaws that make it not so cute. \n\n[b]Design Flaws: [/b]\n1. The hit boxes are poorly constructed. Often the wrong piece moves the wrong direction. \n2. Everything must grind to a complete stop before you can move another piece. Kind of like a 'Hard Candy Christmas' as Dolly would say.\n3. Pieces are not easy to move, as in most repetitive match 3 games. This is where the ritilin effect is most evident. \n\n[h1]It was very cheap. I got it on sale as a time killer. It is sugar free. But, I don't recommend it for anyone of any age. Kids would be frustrated with those hit boxes especially. And, they deserve better games than this. Look elsewhere.[/h1]",
